#  THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Verified 2026-09-04.
#  The rules above already keep spreadsheets, archives and images out, which is most of the way
#  there, but the working tree also collects business documents as MARKDOWN and JSON and those
#  were unprotected: EBITDA and balance-sheet audits, a QuickBooks consolidation, expense data,
#  billing notes, a mailbox search dump, a client handover. None of it has ever been committed,
#  checked across every branch. But 1,283 untracked files sat here against 100 tracked ones, so
#  `git add -A` in this tree was one keystroke from publishing the company's finances.
*_AUDIT_*.md
EBITDA_*.md
BS_AUDIT_*.md
QB_*.md
GRABO_*.md
HANDOVER-*.md
billing*.md
expenses_data.json
doba_*.json
gmail-outbound-search.md

#  Agent working state, not source.
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/

#  Same reasoning, second pass: an expense review, a for-sale report, a sourcing comparison, a
#  pending trademark list, and a vendor binary distribution that is nobody's source.
LV_STORAGE_OPTIONS_*.md
charts/
gripster_shots/
td_pending.json
tm_list.json
ExpansionHunter-*/
